repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/alejandrocuevas-ufro/campylobacter-dta-meta-analysis
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and extracted data for a systematic review and bivariate
  meta-analysis of the diagnostic accuracy of stool antigen immunoassays for
  Campylobacter spp., stratified by platform (lateral flow immunoassay vs
  microplate enzyme immunoassay) and by reference standard (culture vs PCR).
  24 studies, 68 test x reference 2x2 estimates, 13 677 stool specimens.
keywords:
  - Campylobacter
  - diagnostic test accuracy
  - meta-analysis
  - immunoassay
  - bivariate model
  - QUADAS-2
version: 1.0.0
